      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I suggested this a long time ago, as well as translation of the ToS. At certain time, VRChat is filled with Russians and Japanese, and I definitely met users who don't understand English, but they accepted the rules anyway. Instead, VRC should let the users choose preferred language, provide them with the ToS along with a short list of rules (\"TL;DR\"), so only then they could start using the app. I heard a lot of feedback from people who didn't even know why they got banned just because they didn't speak English in the first place.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
