      "mergeID": "5cac01aa1abb3734e4c18d4a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "So apparently. VRChat's popularity is somehow blowing up in Asia, (Mostly Japan and Korea) which the game managed to get an appearance on a Japanese news program.\n\nI think we can clearly understand that not all of the VRChat players are native English speakers. So I was wondering if we are able to get translations for the game in the future at some point? That would really help non-English VRChat players navigate through the UI better if it's translated to their own language.",
