      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it's time to start working on the translation into each language in earnest.\nEspecially for Japanese people, there are very few people who can understand a guide in English when they meet a nuisance during world loading.\n(If we can't make the official tutorial world and the home world multilingual)\nI also think that the reference worlds you can go to from the home world should be separated for each language.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
