  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-26T17:52:38.400Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We've got quite a big community of Chinese, Japanese and Korean on VRChat. But, the UI still doesn't have any translations for these languages which work completely differently than english. Not to speak of Russian, Spanish and Italian communities either.\n\nWe could crowdsource the translation through the community or we might find a different method depending on what the developers say or maybe you've got thoughts about it?\n\nIn any way, it'd be nice to see something like this happening considering how many foreigners who have english as their second language or have difficulty understanding it at all on VRChat and it's always nice to make it easier for them to understand the options menu and the UI itself!\n\nHopefully someone else agrees with me.",
